## Flags

- **My watch-limit numbers are from this test box, not yours.** Run the `sysctl` line on a real jumphost — the defaults differ by build and your hardening baseline may have changed them.
- **The `create` branch triggers a full sweep per directory creation.** On a busy home that could be noisy; rate-limit if `remmina-strip` shows up constantly in the journal.
- Test scripts are at `/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/f20daf88-0775-55fe-8de0-8eb7dde05f3a/scratchpad/inotify_test.py` and `/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/f20daf88-0775-55fe-8de0-8eb7dde05f3a/scratchpad/watch_scale.py` if you want to re-run them on your own kernel — they use only ctypes and stdlib.

